units metal
dimension 3
atom_style atomic
boundary p p f
read_data structures/phasefield_clearance_2p25.data
change_box all z final -10.0 100.0 units box
include potentials/potential_stage69.inc
neighbor 2.0 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
region crater_region cylinder z 9.9573898076 24.2578814220 8.0 12.0 100.0 units box
group active region crater_region
group constrained subtract all active
fix hold constrained setforce 0.0 0.0 0.0
compute fparts all property/atom fx fy fz
variable fmag atom sqrt(c_fparts[1]*c_fparts[1]+c_fparts[2]*c_fparts[2]+c_fparts[3]*c_fparts[3])
compute maxf active reduce max v_fmag
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step atoms pe c_maxf fmax
thermo_modify flush yes
min_style fire
min_modify dmax 0.003
minimize 0.0 0.05 3000 12000
dump f all custom 1 audit/active_local_relaxed_forces.dump id type x y z fx fy fz v_fmag
dump_modify f sort id
run 0
undump f
write_data structures/active_local_relaxed.data
